WEBVTT

00:00:00.732 --> 00:00:04.988
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> 20 billion pieces of Lego <b>are produced</b> every year.

00:00:06.955 --> 00:00:09.765
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> CDs <b>aren’t used</b> very much nowadays.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.930
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> <b>Is</b> Spanish <b>spoken</b> in New Mexico?

00:00:16.874 --> 00:00:20.605
<v><b>Speaker 4:</b></v> The hot-air balloon <b>was invented</b> by two Frenchmen.

00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:26.215
<v><b>Speaker 5:</b></v> Stamps <b>weren’t invented</b> until 1840.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.693
<v><b>Speaker 6:</b></v> When <b>was</b> the mobile phone <b>invented</b>?